  "id": "salpingectomy",
  "term": "salpingectomy",
  "definition": "Salpingectomy is a surgical procedure in which an affected fallopian tube is removed. In this context, losing one tube can reduce future fertility potential and may contribute to fertility-related stress, anxiety, grief, and uncertainty about future pregnancy.",
